  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf se að ðonne forðcume, ceose se man ðe ðær betyhtlod sy swa hwæðer swa he wylle, swa anfeald ordal swa pundes wurðne að innan ðrim hundrede, ofer XXX peninga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the oath is forthcoming, the man who is accused there shall choose whichever he will—either the simple ordeal or an oath equivalent to a pound in value, [supported by compurgators found] within the three hundreds, [in the case of an object] over 30 pence in value.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf se að þonne forðcume, ceose se man, þe þær betihtled syg, swæðer he wylle, swa anfeald ordal swa pundes weorðnc að innan þam þrim hundredan, ofer XXX peninga.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
